  "notes": "euNetworks invoices use a TABLE-STYLE header on page 1: labels on one row (Document No., Customer ID, Invoice Date, Due Date) with values on the row directly below. Line items are multi-row service blocks (S######## service_id, C#####-### billing_reference, amounts in the Net Value column). May be in EUR with Irish/German VAT (often 23%). Some invoices may be in German language. Line amounts are net (pre-tax); extract invoice tax_rate when shown. Currency often appears only in bank details, not as a dedicated label.",
